<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies Las Vegas, Nev., debt.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies Las Vegas, Nev., debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said it has qualified for bond insurance a single municipal issue scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Las Vegas, Nev., $10.5 million general obligation medium-term debt.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
